OL,5,G1600 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FOn patrol across Derbyshire, the
OL,7,     Fofficers tackle a huge variety of
OL,8,     Fcrimes, ranging from drunk or
OL,9,     Fdrugged driving to catching gangs
OL,10,     Fstealing cars or running drugs
OL,11,     Facross county lines.
OL,12,G1700 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FThe team joins forces with the
OL,14,     Fchopper to track down a wanted
OL,15,     Fcriminal on a motorbike, and a
OL,16,     Fyoung driver crashes straight into
OL,17,     Fan unmarked police car.
OL,18,G1800 Police Interceptors
OL,19,     FA torrential downpour hampers
OL,20,     Fpolice at a major crash scene on
OL,21,     Fthe M1, and PC Ange Salous
OL,22,     Fconfronts a not-so-happy chappy.
