OL,16,G2100 Trauma Room One
OL,17,     FJames, 63, is losing feeling and
OL,18,     Ffunction in his hands and fingers.
OL,19,     FSurgeons must act fast to remove
OL,20,     Fdisc and bone from his neck. Will
OL,21,     Fthey save James from an uncertain
OL,22,     Ffuture? (Ep8)
